          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' an waawituú aa waawuti'in baraá yaamaá Edomuwo, qoomár baraá Israeliwo waawuti'iima iwa kahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela oo Beori ina waawuti'ín baraá Edomuwo, nee umuú gixsarós an Dinhaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela iwa gwaá', Yobabu garmoó Sera, oo Bosra, ina waawuti'ín kitaangós wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yobabu iri kahhuút, Hushamu oo baraá yaamaá Temani kitaangós guri óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushamu iwa gwaá', Hadadi garmoó Bedadi iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa alé. Inós an kudá' múk Midiani gwaa baal baraá yaamaá Moabu wa alé. Umuú gixsarós guri báy Awiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadi iri gwaá', Samla oo Marseka ina waawuti'ín kitaangós wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samla iwa gwaá', Saulo oo yaamaá Rehoboti, kudá' bihhaá yaaér Eufrate, iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo iwa gwaá', Ba'al-hanani garmoó Akbori ina waawuti'ín kitaangós wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba'al-hanani, garmoó Akbori, iwa gwaá', Hadari iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa ale, nee umuú gixsarós an Pau. Umuú hareerós an Mehetabeli, dasír Matredi. Aamaarós a Mesahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.39"
            ]
          }
        }
